<title>POLAND: PLI to issue 15 mln in CPs.</title>
<headline>PLI to issue 15 mln in CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish retailer and wholesaler Polish Life Improvement SA (PLI) has signed a contract with Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA (BRE) to issue 15 million zlotys in commercial paper, PLI said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Thursday statement gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
